### Example 07 — event-driven pipeline runs (ADR 0009)
### Health checks against the provider and the consumer.

### LogisticsService — direct ping
GET http://localhost:4455/odata/v4/logistics/Shipments?$top=2

### Example consumer — target table (empty until first batch run)
GET http://localhost:4107/odata/v4/example/Shipments?$top=2

### Management service — pipeline registered?
GET http://localhost:4107/pipeline/Pipelines?$filter=name eq 'Shipments'
